{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "mca of q on skl (skylake)\n  straight-line code: 6 instructions, 7 uops\n     #  instruction                     lat   rtp uops  ports     inputs\n     0  lea       3x                      3     1    1  p1        \n     1  add       3x + 7                  1  0.25    1  p0156     0\n     2  mulx      (3x + 7)/13             4     1    2  p15       1\n     3  shl       (3x + 7)/13             1   0.5    1  p06       2\n     4  popcnt    popcount(x)             3     1    1  p1        \n     5  add       (3x + 7)/13 + popcount(x)    1  0.25    1  p0156     3 4\n    (inputs: instruction numbers; ' = from the previous iteration)\n  port pressure: p0 1.50 p1 2.00 p5 2.00 p6 1.50\n  bounds: critical path 10.00, ports 2.00 (p1), front end 1.75 (7 uops / 4)\n  simulated: 10.00 cycles, limited by the critical path\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "mca", "ucas": "mca q on skl", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "mca", "model": "skl", "blocks": [{"block": "straight-line code", "loop": false, "instructions": [{"text": "lea       3x", "class": "lea", "latency": 3, "rthroughput": 1, "uops": 1, "ports": "p1", "inputs": ""}, {"text": "add       3x + 7", "class": "add", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.25, "uops": 1, "ports": "p0156", "inputs": "0"}, {"text": "mulx      (3x + 7)/13", "class": "mulx", "latency": 4, "rthroughput": 1, "uops": 2, "ports": "p15", "inputs": "1"}, {"text": "shl       (3x + 7)/13", "class": "shl", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.5, "uops": 1, "ports": "p06", "inputs": "2"}, {"text": "popcnt    popcount(x)", "class": "popcnt", "latency": 3, "rthroughput": 1, "uops": 1, "ports": "p1", "inputs": ""}, {"text": "add       (3x + 7)/13 + popcount(x)", "class": "add", "latency": 1, "rthroughput": 0.25, "uops": 1, "ports": "p0156", "inputs": "3 4"}], "pressure": {"p0": 1.5, "p1": 2, "p5": 2, "p6": 1.5}, "cycles": 10, "latency_bound": 10, "port_bound": 2, "busiest_po